    "Install Homebrew (https://brew.sh) to let BlindRSS install these automatically, or install them yourself with:\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\nIf this is a packaged build that should bundle them, see the log: {log_path}\n\nTip: You can disable this prompt in Settings > YouTube.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installieren Sie Homebrew (https://brew.sh), damit BlindRSS diese automatisch installieren kann, oder installieren Sie sie selbst mit:\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\nWenn dies ein paketiertes Build ist, das sie mitliefern sollte, siehe das Protokoll: {log_path}\n\nTipp: Sie können diese Abfrage unter Einstellungen > YouTube deaktivieren."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instale Homebrew (https://brew.sh) para que BlindRSS pueda instalarlos automáticamente, o instálelos usted mismo con:\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\nSi esta es una compilación empaquetada que debería incluirlos, consulte el registro: {log_path}\n\nConsejo: puede desactivar este aviso en Configuración > YouTube."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installez Homebrew (https://brew.sh) pour que BlindRSS puisse les installer automatiquement, ou installez-les vous-même avec :\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\nS'il s'agit d'une version empaquetée censée les inclure, consultez le journal : {log_path}\n\nAstuce : vous pouvez désactiver cette invite dans Paramètres > YouTube."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BlindRSS इन्हें स्वचालित रूप से इंस्टॉल कर सके, इसके लिए Homebrew (https://brew.sh) इंस्टॉल करें, या इन्हें स्वयं इंस्टॉल करें:\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\nयदि यह एक पैकेज्ड बिल्ड है जिसमें ये शामिल होने चाहिए, तो लॉग देखें: {log_path}\n\nसुझाव: आप इस संकेत को सेटिंग्स > YouTube में अक्षम कर सकते हैं।"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installa Homebrew (https://brew.sh) per consentire a BlindRSS di installarli automaticamente, oppure installali manualmente con:\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\nSe questa è una build pacchettizzata che dovrebbe includerli, consulta il registro: {log_path}\n\nSuggerimento: puoi disattivare questa richiesta in Impostazioni > YouTube."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BlindRSS がこれらを自動的にインストールできるように Homebrew (https://brew.sh) をインストールするか、次のコマンドで手動でインストールしてください:\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\nこれらを同梱すべきパッケージビルドの場合は、ログを確認してください: {log_path}\n\nヒント: この確認は 設定 > YouTube で無効にできます。"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installeer Homebrew (https://brew.sh) zodat BlindRSS deze automatisch kan installeren, of installeer ze zelf met:\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\nAls dit een verpakte build is die ze zou moeten meeleveren, raadpleeg dan het logboek: {log_path}\n\nTip: u kunt deze vraag uitschakelen in Instellingen > YouTube."
          }
        },
        "nl-BE": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installeer Homebrew (https://brew.sh) zodat BlindRSS deze automatisch kan installeren, of installeer ze zelf met:\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\nAls dit een verpakte build is die ze zou moeten meeleveren, raadpleeg dan het logboek: {log_path}\n\nTip: u kunt deze vraag uitschakelen in Instellingen > YouTube."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zainstaluj Homebrew (https://brew.sh), aby BlindRSS mógł zainstalować je automatycznie, lub zainstaluj je samodzielnie:\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\nJeśli jest to spakowana kompilacja, która powinna je zawierać, sprawdź dziennik: {log_path}\n\nWskazówka: to pytanie możesz wyłączyć w Ustawienia > YouTube."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instale o Homebrew (https://brew.sh) para que o BlindRSS possa instalá-los automaticamente, ou instale-os você mesmo com:\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\nSe esta for uma compilação empacotada que deveria incluí-los, consulte o log: {log_path}\n\nDica: você pode desativar este aviso em Configurações > YouTube."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instale o Homebrew (https://brew.sh) para que o BlindRSS os possa instalar automaticamente, ou instale-os manualmente com:\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\nSe esta for uma compilação empacotada que os deveria incluir, consulte o registo: {log_path}\n\nSugestão: pode desativar este aviso em Definições > YouTube."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Установите Homebrew (https://brew.sh), чтобы позволить BlindRSS устанавливать их автоматически, или установите их самостоятельно при помощи:\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\nЕсли это пакетная сборка, которая должна их упаковать, см. журнал: {log_path}\n\nСовет: Вы можете отключить этот запрос в \"Настройки\" > YouTube."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installera Homebrew (https://brew.sh) så att BlindRSS kan installera dessa automatiskt, eller installera dem själv med:\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\nOm det här är ett paketerat bygge som borde inkludera dem, se loggen: {log_path}\n\nTips: du kan inaktivera den här frågan i Inställningar > YouTube."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装 Homebrew (https://brew.sh) 以便 BlindRSS 自动安装它们，或者自行安装：\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\n如果这是本应捆绑它们的打包版本，请查看日志：{log_path}\n\n提示：您可以在“设置 > YouTube”中禁用此提示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安裝 Homebrew (https://brew.sh) 以便 BlindRSS 自動安裝它們，或者自行安裝：\n    brew install --cask vlc\n    brew install ffmpeg yt-dlp\n\n如果這是本應綑定它們的打包版本，請查看日誌：{log_path}\n\n提示：您可以在「設定 > YouTube」中停用此提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Linux build should already bundle these tools.\nIf they still appear missing, see the log: {log_path}\n\nTip: You can disable this prompt in Settings > YouTube.": {
      "localizations": {
